## 🔍 Debugging por Modo

### Admin Mode
```bash
# Ver logs de autenticación
tail -f storage/logs/laravel.log | grep "admin_login"

# Ver logs de operaciones admin
tail -f storage/logs/laravel.log | grep "admin_operation"
```

### Simple Mode
```bash
# Ver logs de simple unblock
tail -f storage/logs/laravel.log | grep "Simple unblock"

# Ver logs de rate limiting
tail -f storage/logs/laravel.log | grep "Rate limit"

# Ver intentos silenciosos (reportados solo a admin)
tail -f storage/logs/laravel.log | grep "silent_log"
```

